{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_title", "source_sha256": "c397db582ecc1f82c1a508d44cdeb1a1c95159d4be45e88ead2d5fb91e7be9dc", "ja": "双星到来☆スウィングバイ！", "zh": "双星到来☆引力加速！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6270d429530bc7333698a4121267bd93d52730892c755e0199b89e3e4d3aa29a", "ja": "サイミン術で眠りに落ちたプロデューサー。\n気が付くとキャプテンアミマミ率いる宇宙船\nに搭乗し、『奴ら』を倒し、シングバイバイ\nして地球に到着。亜美と真美は『わくわく』\nを届けるため、いざセンター公演へ！", "zh": "制作人因催眠术陷入沉睡。\n回过神来，竟已登上了亚美真美舰长率领的宇宙飞船\n，打倒了“那些家伙”，挥歌作别\n抵达了地球。为了传达这份“兴奋雀跃”，\n亚美和真美毅然前往中心公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "25ad67d1661ef2b1881360fb38708a18be082ace4380806457c0951d053f1347", "ja": "……キャプテンズLOG\nミリオン歴2020年そこら……。", "zh": "……舰长日志\n百万历2020年左右……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "ddf2c2fd2b35a05074fdf36891cbe6bec4b59425b0d198e4fb5de71a215d50ae", "ja": "我々と同盟を結ぶ惑星『地球』より、救難信号を受信。", "zh": "已收到来自与我方结盟的行星『地球』发来的求救信号。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "b6d464e9100437b3a62db0e37f07a417110a62e77ea48e7ee89a5d3a95572a29", "ja": "地球では、希少な資源『わくわく』の欠乏により、住民\nが困窮しているらしい。なんとも心痛ましいことだ。", "zh": "据说地球因为稀缺资源“兴奋感”陷入匮乏，导致居民\n生活困苦。真是令人痛心疾首啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "8e416759105a4c76a4ea3f96a00dfcdfe19eb02348ecd8a10c96c653af4857c4", "ja": "宇宙連邦所属の我が宇宙船『ジェミ2号』は、\n直ちに救援に向かうこととなった。", "zh": "隶属于宇宙联邦的本宇宙船“双子2号”，\n决定立刻前往救援。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "a527e6a0180aeae2e617008274fafc9b88d3f92796deac4abbff43d57f6373e6", "ja": "まぁ、難しいことは置いといて、\nなんやかんやで旅の無事を祈るとしよう……。", "zh": "嘛，复杂的事先搁在一旁，\n总之先来祈祷旅途平安吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1005_null", "source_sha256": "474652adca4f414299ebd4034f5a9e20827f8d24a6b5fecab0c2fcde2f5067b2", "ja": "―ジェミ2号内部―", "zh": "―双子座2号内部―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "2d37d32d645fd27e3dbd5145a3a7d63bb84df7fc0dfa76a486dd582aae8137ad", "ja": "今回の渡航。燃料である『ミリオン鉱石』が\n最低限しか用意できなかったのが気がかりだ……。", "zh": "这次的航行，只准备了最低限度的燃料“百万矿石”，实在令人担忧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "553ff680efed599426519d8f877dd8aed95aa009b528aadc2e1db15352646bfb", "ja": "パイロット、現在の状況はいかがかな。", "zh": "飞行员，现在情况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "33e3fa01f26f46d4e59a48fcd4ebced278aad7492236473ee1cfdffcecc088fd", "ja": "すべて問題ありません、キャプテン。", "zh": "一切正常，队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7c35399f1faccfc784decd9c378d2454ab0f5ca588f2f2c527afa026b84ee3b1", "ja": "（……ん？）", "zh": "（……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "a357314f7c3961a382b30e7cb0b2f099e6dcecb315c1261784df2cc2057361ad", "ja": "このまま何事もなく地球に到着できればいいのですが。\nそう、『奴ら』さえ現れなければな……。", "zh": "要是能这样平安无事地抵达地球就好了。\n没错，只要“那些家伙”别出现就行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "4ff98b704acd41866f8160f238961d8faef40dc3471b3402b68d9c47ce486012", "ja": "うむ。しかし、先のことを気にしても仕方がないさ、\nサイエンティスト。そうだろう？", "zh": "嗯。不过，去操心以后的事也无济于事，\n科学家。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "c46ac002ba8234ae40a3795f5b7f11068c47e4a0e6873db5ec37e1a9892c8253", "ja": "はい。しかし自分は不安です。『奴ら』に滅ぼされた\n同盟の船は数知れません。ましてや、我が船には……。", "zh": "是。不过，我还是很不安。被“那些家伙”毁灭的同盟船只数不胜数。更何况，我们的船上还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b4ba0e18d4e506e0361f65a7218e7ff59b0a69ee2a1d41155117f791deb01c2b", "ja": "（……あれ？　なんだこれ。みんながいるようだけど、\nここは劇場ではないような……？）", "zh": "（……咦？这是什么？大家好像都在这里，可这里似乎不是剧场……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0de0e798eaaf0202439fdb2fa9c0417e0ac03632924de57e08301071fe067b36", "ja": "（確かに真美に何かされて寝ちゃって……。\nそれからええと……）", "zh": "（确实是被真美做了什么之后睡着了……然后，呃……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1015_se", "source_sha256": "1030f5a0f3ae895c9de0a92b4fb2529de6989e9b18e9a420fe5b35d42ae143e4", "ja": "ビーッ！　ビーッ！", "zh": "哔——！　哔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1016_p", "source_sha256": "510d95feab12fdba9330e9ccd072ba81955c200228b887c18071880d9beb04f0", "ja": "う、うわ！？", "zh": "哇、哇啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "fe04eb77411345519b86ae6d0f90a3e8224cec043ace7b3e73870eec90fd2da2", "ja": "……！！　て、敵襲！", "zh": "……！！　敌、敌袭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "bc82eca47ea811d210b273d94d220986188c79e14afcc6e0c7f267fc33000ef1", "ja": "くそっ、現れたか、悪のエイリアン！\nもうダメだ！　あたしは死ぬ前にギターを弾くっ！！", "zh": "可恶，出现了吗，邪恶的外星人！  \n已经完了！我得在死之前弹吉他！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "95237d1b6395a6ab232dc786af7e772bd1b84a01380e4c65c29f17f280d63809", "ja": "落ち着きたまえ、サイエンティスト！　\nオペレーター、ミリオン砲の準備を！", "zh": "冷静点，科学家！\n操作员，准备百万炮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "f4420f60c608983e87d00b08d0175559aa97d11b77d5fdff258caad353a6910f", "ja": "し、しかし、ミリオン砲を撃ってしまうと、\n燃料の『ミリオン鉱石』が地球まで持つかどうか……。", "zh": "可、可是，一旦发射百万炮，作为燃料的“百万矿石”能不能撑到地球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "f58a1f723280d891270fd3edec24321f2ba8c675733ea333831273e4ee9d080d", "ja": "いいのだ！　ていうかキャプテンはアレが撃ちたい！\nまーなんとかなるっしょ！　コホン、準備開始ッ！", "zh": "没问题！不如说本舰长就是想开那一炮！\n哎呀总会有办法的啦！咳咳，开始准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "ad5f7f882856f55f193205d22fd5b591a04915a70025ad6601974e39928fc55d", "ja": "は、はい！　ミリオン砲充填開始、30……50……\n80……、ひゃくまんパワー！！　撃てますっ！", "zh": "是、是的！百万炮开始充填，30……50……\n80……百万力量！！可以发射了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "ad99f03cdb21783d1844936c311b0b8236f54631cdebf79f91cc551e054b4d2e", "ja": "よし、各員衝撃に備えろ！\nミリオン砲、発射ぁああぁああッ！！", "zh": "好，所有人准备承受冲击！\n百万炮，发射——啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1024_se", "source_sha256": "9de22459ae8f8c78ef8dc5d6c1742e1781fc37c4fbed69475da6e8021dd3fe0b", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴゴ！！\nズゴーーン……！！！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆隆隆隆隆隆隆！！\n轰——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3b58eb7c113d125e62a78b9d458c191dd2c495c3ab2ed4dcf0519208b3d9eefd", "ja": "（……え、これ、もしかして……夢？）", "zh": "（……诶，这难道是……梦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf4ddeadd7138be813d6c3ac9aa3691cba1130dfcaeeb364687e270c12bb6f7a", "ja": "はあ、はあ……やったか！？", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……成功了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "400d306b5c7f463a4c47852853dcef29ade5eca1c61ae2e1b024216c3ba18b37", "ja": "オペレーター！　レーダーの反応は！？", "zh": "操作员！雷达有什么反应！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "e6df83e42fa931be05ca5033d448da091984a77cebdebaa8ba7829a3275ca9bc", "ja": "敵機反応、ゼロです！　やりました、キャプテン！", "zh": "敌机反应，为零！我们成功了，舰长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "e2da8d94fdf8f35b5072185729ab4a70c8de028dc237c11092614ca66a64840c", "ja": "はははは！　雑魚どもめ！　悪のエイリアンと\nいえども、我がミリオン砲の前では所詮ムシケラよ！", "zh": "哈哈哈哈！一群杂鱼！就算是邪恶的外星人，在我百万大炮面前也不过是一群小虫子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1030_p", "source_sha256": "3c041316862dcc4c16eef791567cfa010a054b50c41099aeffcffaffc1268863", "ja": "あー、えっと……亜美？　だよな？", "zh": "啊——呃……你是亚美？对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "879e69af983a33985b907d4af1738d169d88d3f977d152941aa45fef63b6343f", "ja": "キャプテンと呼びたまえ！　君もぼーっとしてないで、\n自分の任務に専念したま……。", "zh": "叫我队长！你也别发呆，专心执行自己的任务……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1032_se", "source_sha256": "1030f5a0f3ae895c9de0a92b4fb2529de6989e9b18e9a420fe5b35d42ae143e4", "ja": "ビーッ！　ビーッ！", "zh": "哔——！　哔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1033_p", "source_sha256": "e8a5b6990aba734cba517cd21b6ac1c805aa0d8e6b8bd6ee202c81f315d03a82", "ja": "こ、今度はなんだ！？", "zh": "这、这次又是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "4e6f8eb49bfb95a2475cc4087339aef14fb9a2244862d51ba665c4f0e5108415", "ja": "しまった…先ほどのミリオン砲で燃料が足りなくなった\nようだ。我々の旅も、どうやらここまでだな……。", "zh": "糟了……刚才那发百万炮弹好像把燃料用光了。我们的旅途，看来也要到此为止了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1035_011ami", "source_sha256": "912b0d7ad7a9b15050d364ae15c721c77f5a7c61a6bc5c9b93232c62e3e5e6f8", "ja": "死ぬ前に一度言ってみたかった……。\n「地球か……なんとなく懐かしい感じだ……」とな。", "zh": "在死之前……有句话一直想说一次……\n“地球啊……总觉得有种怀念的感觉……”之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1036_p", "source_sha256": "ea8eac0fd7c88a748083c16515a83ac48cc5b15b6ff7f2bf648ba2084c513fd3", "ja": "えっ。あきらめるのが早くないか？", "zh": "诶。放弃得是不是太快了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1037_011ami", "source_sha256": "f05b7548d42bde5f32f3d63685c309ebac80d2d374ab132d5cf7b2ccde5fa8d2", "ja": "むむ、じゃあ何か解決案を考えてみよ！　キャプテンは\n寛大だかんね。部下の意見はちゃんと聞くよ！", "zh": "唔唔，那就来想个解决办法吧！船长我可是\n很宽宏大量的。部下的意见我都会好好听取哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "591031dbacc17e3156643041a6340c8e05af9419346864d44b5eefe9b942b8fb", "ja": "困ったクルーをプロデュースするのが君の仕事っしょ？\nほらほら、早く早く！　アドバイスカモ～ン♪", "zh": "为遇上麻烦的船员出谋划策，就是你的工作对吧？\n好啦好啦，快点快点！快来提点建议吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1039_p", "source_sha256": "6512dc447b24091339f56456b4bf1f5d6d9e32620d1b6c01eae99974086fb3dd", "ja": "なんかもう普通に亜美と真美じゃないか……。\nう～ん、そうだな。ちょうど宇宙のことを調べてて……", "zh": "感觉这不就是普通的亚美和真美嘛……\n嗯——是啊，我正好在调查宇宙的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1040_p", "source_sha256": "c9ab5e6aa13bfc3f176c86cd33938905b709ed3c967ad578ab5db5e3c0852521", "ja": "あ、こういうのはどうだ？　どこかの星の重力を利用\nして、この船を引っ張ってもらう、……みたいな。", "zh": "啊，这样怎么样？利用某颗星球的引力，\n让它帮忙拉动这艘船……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "53a731f78b30eb491083435ddd1aceda48d4ca13da8a258ddd5168d5afd484f3", "ja": "ふむ……なるほど。\nシングバイバイ、というやつか。", "zh": "嗯……原来如此。\n也就是所谓的借力飞行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1042_p", "source_sha256": "15e87ce4298bd206702b48689c9784aecf1c53c62f6ff4f3754d66cf54b55ab5", "ja": "いや、スウィングバイだが。", "zh": "不，是引力弹弓（Swing-by）啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "b92f5adaf05d6343750d3aec8be3de60c33118c68787d10adb154f618940f3a8", "ja": "そうか！　ちょうどここから地球まで、太陽系の惑星が\n続いている。その重力を利用すれば……。", "zh": "这样啊！正好从这里到地球，太阳系的行星一个接一个。利用它们的引力的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "22d3ba62d6bf7d684b5294505bd1d0d9ab02a341508cd348761d839d4f6b005a", "ja": "うん、うまいこと近くのワームホールに\n突入できそうだ！　あんた、意外とやるじゃないか！", "zh": "嗯，看来能顺利冲进\n附近的虫洞了！你这家伙，意外地挺能干嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1045_p", "source_sha256": "4e0fc1923e854deb4d7fdb4fa8ed4a28e45550a4b2850ce4344b8e8eae0680cb", "ja": "そ、そうか。はは、役に立てて良かったよ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。哈哈，能帮上忙就好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1046_012mam", "source_sha256": "32c1a21b9e75a7ae0dc864e41d07b7129cf8b03169bb5914a8ec241b2c42b9d4", "ja": "よーし、じゃあそれ採用！　あとはパイロットよ、\n君の方向感覚が頼りだ！　ひとつ、よろしくちゃん！", "zh": "好～嘞，那就采纳这个！接下来，驾驶员啊，\n就全靠你的方向感了！万事拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1047_010azu", "source_sha256": "07fd4d14022cfbc4c7dc7178f75ee982a9787c89c8b634086c25f09791fb1ed2", "ja": "ええ、任せてください！", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1048_p", "source_sha256": "dd84de266625664f1972a13dc8e8835811ac1bf7d8e50cdeb1c643b95a4f9016", "ja": "なんだって！？　あずささんに！？", "zh": "什么！？给あずさ小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1049_010azu", "source_sha256": "df8ec2ca2be956a0b75db3ba59e5a6b7e0e5839ca5f83f7036ab996beac73246", "ja": "では、これより星々の重力を利用して船の動力とし、\nその速度で近くのワームホールに突入してみます。", "zh": "那么接下来，我们就利用群星的引力作为飞船的动力，以这个速度尝试进入附近的虫洞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1050_010azu", "source_sha256": "d6c9279aa377eed8f49076c0147954105bd9f7b7957d68db621237dcad32911a", "ja": "えーっと、確か地球の距離がこれくらいだから、\nだいたい……これくらいかしら～。", "zh": "呃，我记得地球的距离大概是这么远，所以……差不多就是这个程度吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1051_012mam", "source_sha256": "3e2d322beacf380f4a2e6206222ae5c4c336efed668927fcc8861eba15e61a27", "ja": "コンピューターに頼らず、全て直感でやり遂げる……\nフッ、さすが我が船の天才的パイロットよ！", "zh": "不依靠电脑，完全凭直觉完成……\n哼，不愧是我船上的天才飞行员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1052_p", "source_sha256": "12b1bbd0f028a2098c90f6413d9eab4cd15f0f55b2966dc2a08288c7aea93942", "ja": "そ、そうなのか……。\nよし、その設定を信じよう！", "zh": "这、这样的吗……好，那就相信这个设定吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1053_010azu", "source_sha256": "9e0365d3c12b6dc1d8d1ed401d0db85e1d51e6100694914935d5d5adb0c0c621", "ja": "では、ちょっと荒っぽい運転になりますから。\n……みんな、しっかり掴まっててね！", "zh": "那么，接下来驾驶会有点颠簸。\n……大家，要抓紧了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1054_se", "source_sha256": "8fe3f3d9a50112d5df44a9576f035b75d067be7c2dbec73b895ef08be2c4f888", "ja": "ギュイーーーーーーーン！！！！！！", "zh": "嗡——————！！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1055_p", "source_sha256": "51e0f6631c345b5b34e866e7d3b2eb2c2441d7d0e4de9cfa2578fd3c2a3be39a", "ja": "わわっ！？　速度が早まった！　すごいGだ！", "zh": "哇哇！？　速度变快了！好惊人的重力加速度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1056_010azu", "source_sha256": "ae3956d588af611531b2c81fa49732b210d0a159ba7d7f01d4edb0dcbed017c1", "ja": "ワームホール発見！　一気に飛び込みますよっ！\nみんな、衝撃に備えて！！", "zh": "发现虫洞！要一口气冲进去啦！\n大家，做好承受冲击的准备！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1057_011ami", "source_sha256": "3ed2da92a8ca09b9acfb7b22faf32717a3354797e60af98cf00a5abdcac78d93", "ja": "うわああああああああああっ！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
