{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1061_045kar", "source_sha256": "3ed2da92a8ca09b9acfb7b22faf32717a3354797e60af98cf00a5abdcac78d93", "ja": "うわああああああああああっ！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1062_045kar", "source_sha256": "1a3bd11187abedf94cf986df1064e7a05e8ff701d2e1c2d69924081c993aedad", "ja": "……！　み、見てください、みなさん！　地球が……。", "zh": "……！请、请大家看！地球它……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1063_010azu", "source_sha256": "95009be5a78bb78a2e84bb69cdbae87c0f270b464c15cf835188c8ff6b4264d5", "ja": "やりました！　ワープが成功して、\n地球の軌道に乗れたみたいですね♪", "zh": "成功了！跃迁成功了，看来我们已经进入地球轨道了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1064_012mam", "source_sha256": "c55a31ab12497ac960d9f315a1464313f3bd2d6dc6d2d17ce90ae957fb5b5459", "ja": "ふっ、今回のオペレーションも成功か。やはり吾輩の\n辞書に不可能の文字はないな。消しゴムで消したし。", "zh": "哼，这次的行动也成功了啊。果然，我的字典里没有“不可能”这两个字。毕竟已经用橡皮擦掉了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1065_050jul", "source_sha256": "0d92d3d5614d15fa689cad2f9278169fc7c80f80ef806405c70dafeb20c53c10", "ja": "キレイな光だよな……。\nああ、あんたは初めてだったか、地球。", "zh": "真是美丽的光啊……\n对了，你还是第一次见到地球吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1066_p", "source_sha256": "5210f6eb0e8bae03d933409038e2b31df7b204f6e493e76c7378d879006d19e1", "ja": "え、俺？　ま、まあ、生で見るのは\n初めて……みたいな感じかな？", "zh": "咦，我？嘛，算是第一次亲眼看到……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1067_050jul", "source_sha256": "280ce009cfc7ff47bad3eabdc3d25743dde76d910c6786b62a72a6b0cffc32c2", "ja": "ははっ。まあ、なんだっていいさ。\n地球は何度見ても、キレイだ。本当に……。", "zh": "哈哈。嘛，怎样都好啦。  \n地球无论看多少次，都很美。真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1068_p", "source_sha256": "0e200e4d3d75d2f56342f0ef5dcde11122d8a01eb12fdbefb7f5ad6e3efbbbc2", "ja": "確かに、青くて……本当に綺麗な輝きだな。\n何度見ても……。うん、何度見たとしても。", "zh": "确实，那片蓝色……真的是美丽的光辉啊。\n不管看多少次……嗯，不管看多少次都好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1069_011ami", "source_sha256": "46a8f59ec636c8a1d4190df5286d3056fd4a60e592e1807397f1ba2a43ff1e5d", "ja": "さあ、諸君！　すぐに降下するぞ！　地球の住民を\n助けるため、『わくわく』を届けようっ！", "zh": "那么，各位！我们马上就要降落了！为了帮助地球居民，把“兴奋”送到他们身边吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1070_012mam", "source_sha256": "9117ce5f7fb1f7910f653a488ee2ddd3a42b0a6806defe3b3ca89aac2c3b4c98", "ja": "我々が地球の住民の希望の流星になるのだ！\n目指すは約束の地！　のりこめー！", "zh": "我们要成为地球居民希望的流星！目标是约定之地！冲进去——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1071_p", "source_sha256": "63ae53060340abe574930b09132286b67d970fc95eccdf679ea0b0f609d1b7a5", "ja": "って、ここは……え？　劇場？", "zh": "可是，这里是……咦？剧场？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1072_011ami", "source_sha256": "5723c83aa5ecd13c8e86b11b15839b46784ff4daee7c50b1976ca5a900dc6335", "ja": "ほら、何をしているのかね？　みんなに『わくわく』を\n届けるため、あそこで公演をするのだろう？", "zh": "喂，你还在做什么呢？不是要在那里演出，把“期待”传递给大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1073_012mam", "source_sha256": "a3f66e1b806b224060026cce093c618571d0e7b20188e29af511b3ceefaf5c0a", "ja": "さあ急ぐぞ！　みんなが我々を待っている！\nなんたって、ダブルセンターだし♪", "zh": "快，赶紧走！大家都在等着我们呢！\n毕竟我们可是双中心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1074_p", "source_sha256": "94d0c99f808a980088c17dd5f75aa3d7dcb28beebb45aa2eb5dcf6593045cbf4", "ja": "あれ、キャプ……え、亜美？　真美？", "zh": "咦，队长……诶，亚美？真美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1075_011ami", "source_sha256": "069083a55846640c8366c36db03ebc32f94a6e90cdcb49dfdec77caeca662605", "ja": "あ、そだ。\nウォッホン！　これを君に渡しておこう。", "zh": "啊，对了。\n咳咳！这个先交给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1076_p", "source_sha256": "e03e79a07f7ac2746f7766171aac32379e731727521ea7c6904576899e147598", "ja": "ん？　これは……。", "zh": "嗯？这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1077_p", "source_sha256": "f0dd8a335761ba9c9050ca1e1fcc50d4eb2e7252cf0d9957282b8b069811e424", "ja": "（ほのかに黄色く光る、小さな石……。\n透明で、琥珀みたいな感じだけど……？）", "zh": "（一块泛着淡淡黄色光芒的小石头……\n透明的，感觉像琥珀一样……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1078_012mam", "source_sha256": "0258fbe8ff1ec00ea8d8007ff1fab6e7399ddb92fa5243c1901f94662bcddbdd", "ja": "ふふふ、美しいだろう。\nそれは『ミリオン鉱石』のカケラだ。", "zh": "呵呵呵，很美吧。\n这是“百万矿石”的碎片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1079_012mam", "source_sha256": "ffd1d0a59dcc9bd648b06cf206959ee73e1056a6c0cdfc51cc557132e21d839c", "ja": "まれにだが、燃料となる『ミリオン鉱石』が弾け、\nそのようなカケラが生まれることがある。", "zh": "虽然罕见，但作为燃料的“百万矿石”迸裂时，\n有时便会产生那样的碎片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1080_011ami", "source_sha256": "fd9e4809e814bf38874c5558e169f8eb79f0c6b10058e3fa66dadabedd828597", "ja": "航海中にそれが手に入るのは、\nとても縁起のいいことなのだ。", "zh": "能在航海途中得到它，是非常吉利的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1081_012mam", "source_sha256": "3297b06b2c966f3e3e88487230b17522ba4bd16ec545b1bbec80be91675df3c4", "ja": "キャプテンは、そのカケラを一番信頼する\nクルーに託す。誰にも知られぬようにな。", "zh": "船长会把那块碎片托付给最信任的船员。别让任何人知道哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1082_p", "source_sha256": "aa5e25e8bfee64358e9bfc47d9cdb774ae1ab7a1bca0b4edc09d933d3ef25c65", "ja": "へえ……。なんだかロマンチックだな。", "zh": "哎……感觉还挺浪漫的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1083_011ami", "source_sha256": "dc17db7c9baf92cec73c993279d4ad4b4533496c7673b192ccf3315f9ed2df09", "ja": "……というか、そんなことも忘れたのかね？\n君は何年我々のクルーをやっている！？", "zh": "……话说回来，你连这种事都忘了吗？\n你当了我们船员几年了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1084_p", "source_sha256": "785b42464932010f51f8277c3b23322945fdcdd6644e23a0496faa6f3ea08cba", "ja": "えーっと。どうだったかな……。\nでも、なんでそんな大事なものを俺に？", "zh": "呃……怎么说来着……。\n不过，为什么要把那么重要的东西交给我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1085_011ami", "source_sha256": "65244c4e7a403f503c21b87bb879258ec9aacf630d689dd3c1782850dfd09eb3", "ja": "え？　だってそれは……ねぇ？", "zh": "诶？因为那个……你说对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1086_012mam", "source_sha256": "4debbf5c74c13bdb247dc88e4eaeab312d185bd4b6bc636e053329c70670529a", "ja": "そうだよねぇ？　だって……。", "zh": "就是嘛？因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1087_011ami", "source_sha256": "3f6502a175679bcc0881b4d85d74b9d9e5d519360784ff4dffdf466d884d3f25", "ja": "兄ちゃんは、亜美（真美）の兄ちゃんだもん♪", "zh": "哥哥是亚美（真美）的哥哥嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1088_012mam", "source_sha256": "e2b6658bbda0467d974f2af42b0846064bcf0ce27833302979d1f148ad420f3d", "ja": "兄ちゃんは、真美の兄ちゃんだもん♪", "zh": "哥哥就是真美的哥哥嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
