{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1090_011ami", "source_sha256": "7d39ad6304f56c26ceb4ba24fd2b9eae3d38b38264a6d9b3042eb59c740adba5", "ja": "んじゃ、ちょっくら『わくわく』欠乏症の\n兄ちゃん姉ちゃんたちを、盛り上げて来ますかー！", "zh": "那我们就稍微去让缺乏“兴奋感”的\n小哥小姐姐们嗨起来吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_063_1091_012mam", "source_sha256": "83f94acefb2420afbcf4479f485b21c40e284f8c83368e55c591bf2b96cf83ba", "ja": "ほらほら、兄ちゃんにもまだやることあるっしょ！\n真美たちのセンター公演のプロデュース♪", "zh": "快快，哥哥也还有事情要做吧！\n那就是制作人美她们的中心公演♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
